i386 ALSA-to-OSS files for the 32-bit Wine overlay and glibc rootfs.

The plugins and ALSA configuration were copied from the locally available
Debian i386 extraction at /home/ubuntu/wine32-stage/img386, populated by the
offline package libasound2-plugins_1.2.7.1-1_i386.deb in
/home/ubuntu/wine32-stage/debpool. The 64-bit counterpart is staged from
tools/rootfs64/alsa by build-wine64-zip.sh.

After copying the runtime input archives into a real web/runtime directory,
run tools/rootfs64/stage-alsa32.sh web/runtime. It adds the OSS plugins to
wine32.zip and the ALSA config plus asound.conf to glibc-rootfs32.zip.
